/// PENDING , and then retry. When the approval succeeds, Connect Customer
/// cancels any overtime or voluntary time off activity that overlaps the
/// approved window. Connect Customer doesn't check whether the principal
/// that calls this operation supervises the user. The staffing group's
/// approval settings also don't apply. IAM permissions are the only
